<oops:Code>P20</oops:Code><oops:Name>Misusing ontology annotations</oops:Name>
<oops:Description>The contents of some annotation properties are swapped or misused. This pitfall might affect annotation properties related to natural language information (for example, annotations for naming such as rdfs:label or for providing descriptions such as rdfs:comment). Other types of annotation could also be affected as temporal, versioning information, among others.	</oops:Description>
